---
import PresetTabs from './PresetTabs.vue';
---

<section class="section" id="presets" aria-labelledby="presets-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="presets-title">Pick a preset, sweep</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
      A preset decides what <code>br sweep</code> cleans. It shows the plan and asks once before it
      acts. Every preset skips unmerged and uncommitted work, dirty worktrees and worktrees whose
      upstream is gone; <code>br review</code> decides on those one by one.
    </p>
    <PresetTabs client:visible />
    <noscript>
      <style is:inline>
        #presets [role='tablist'] {
          display: none;
        }
        #presets [role='tabpanel'][hidden] {
          display: block;
          margin-top: var(--space-5);
        }
      </style>
    </noscript>
  </div>
</section>
